title: Shrine_LanternsDay
---
Five stone lanterns line the path from the gate to the hall.
The one by the gate is black with soot. Each one after it is a little cleaner, and the one by the hall is almost white.
<<flag clue_lantern_soot>>
===
title: Lantern_1
---
<<if met("flag:lanterns_lit")>>
The lantern by the gate burns steadily. Snow drips from its cap.
<<else>>
The lantern by the gate. Its stone is black with old soot.
<<flag clue_lantern_soot>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Lantern_2
---
<<if met("flag:lanterns_lit")>>
The second lantern burns steadily.
<<else>>
Dark grey with soot. Not quite as black as the one by the gate.
<<flag clue_lantern_soot>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Lantern_3
---
<<if met("flag:lanterns_lit")>>
The middle lantern burns steadily.
<<else>>
The middle lantern. A little soot, about half as much as the first.
<<flag clue_lantern_soot>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Lantern_4
---
<<if met("flag:lanterns_lit")>>
The fourth lantern burns steadily.
<<else>>
Only a faint ring of soot under the cap.
<<flag clue_lantern_soot>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Lantern_5
---
<<if met("flag:lanterns_lit")>>
The lantern by the hall burns steadily. Its stone looks new in the light.
<<else>>
The lantern by the hall. The stone is almost clean, as if it has hardly ever burned.
<<flag clue_lantern_soot>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Shrine_OfferingBox
---
<<if met("item:matchbox")>>
The offering box. Only snow in it now.
<<else>>
The offering box is full of snow. Under it, someone has left a box of matches. Dry, somehow.
<<give matchbox>>
<<endif>>
===
title: Lanterns_Gutter
---
The match flares. The flame curls away from the wick and dies.
===
title: Lanterns_Solved
---
The last lantern catches. Five flames burn in a row, from the gate to the hall.
Behind them, the snow slides off the hall doors with a soft hiss.
===
title: CloseUp_Nothing
---
Nothing happens.
===
